From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:35:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] Round 2: Group ready trains by the resource of their
 next leg

Keep one 128-bit ready mask per resource and a mask of resources with
waiting trains. Each dispatch pass checks a resource's availability once
and ranks only trains waiting for available resources, with an explicit
(score, earlier waiting start, lower index) key. A randomized test
compares the kernel with the 0.2.0 dispatcher on full traced output,
steps and work-limit points.

Workload: domain (48 full records, 110 trains, one worker), 11 samples.
Before median: 4.823 ms. After median: 2.637 ms. Speedup: 1.83x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
